Source of truth: @AGENTS.md. API layer specifics:

- Services (`src/api/services`) are thin: return `ApiResponse<T>`, never assert.
- Validate payloads with zod schemas + `expectSchema()`; specs assert status and data.
- Use `bookingService`, `createBooking`, `cleanup` fixtures; tag with `TAGS.api`.
- Template: `.ai/templates/service.ts.md`; prompt: `.ai/prompts/new-api-service-from-openapi.md`.
